{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S03、S08、S11等较短段落中感受词仍然偏密，容易让观众来不及逐条接住；Y的人物心理转折和因果解释更顺畅。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的短句和【】强调让观众更容易迅速抓住每段的核心转折，而且感受字较小、部分随音乐节点出现，适合边听边扫。Y对人物为什么怀念、为什么动摇、为什么最终不回头解释得更充分，故事因果衔接也更自然。不过，X对音乐的力度、音型、音色、节奏变化及其对应的心理感受描写明显更细腻具体，能让观众不仅听懂故事，还能感受到音乐怎样推动故事。综合考虑屏幕阅读体验与音乐同步体验，我选X。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1fef7e6a-3e53-4c6b-93ba-16a988558bfb", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T062857173383Z", "elapsed_seconds": 142.297, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T06:31:19.491119+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7a0a03009ff411258436fcf27ca301925209c606182732b12a00b70d1448e614", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatg